{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":29,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":29,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":361,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/%E5%AF%BC%E6%B8%B8/avatar.png","skin":"导游","skin_cn":"导游"}],"family_name":"勇美","given_name":"枫","family_name_jp":"勇美","given_name_jp":"カエデ","family_name_kr":"이사미","given_name_kr":"카에데","family_name_en":"Isami","given_name_en":"Kaede","family_name_zh_tw":"勇美","given_name_zh_tw":"楓","family_name_cn":"勇美","given_name_cn":"枫","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"喂喂~！今天我们玩什么？！","main_relation":47,"relation":[46,24],"age":15,"grade":"一年生","height":142,"birthday":"07-09","hobby":"恶作剧（尽可能忍耐中）、抓独角仙","designer":"kokosando","illustrator":"kokosando","character_voice":"加藤英美里","character_voice_cn":"写川","release_date":"2022-04-27","release_date_cn":"2024-04-18","release_date_global":"2022-11-29","school":9,"weapon_type":"HG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Small","special_appearance":true,"spine":[485,314,232,768],"model":[40,397],"voice":[{"description":"Kaede_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案！","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/stupmHbggQub4FCnblsR5t7ZMEXbYMUY.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"呼，好困……眼睛……实在是……呜……","text_original":"ふぁ、ねむ……目が、もう……んむ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/RjlUVQQCjUTF5j5X0pbb8IkBsRUaZfow.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"根据我的观察……！这里很适合捉迷藏……！","text_original":"私の測定によると……ここは、鬼ごっこに最適な場所！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/QEiT0ik6tZH4LIkUx0vv5jpJ0lNuLCWg.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"哼哼哼~♪那个那个，今天要做什么呢？","text_original":"ふんふん～♪ ねぇねぇ、今日は何する？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/XxqZwBzGxFxKj8ccNiFzNKn7bgl1zmWs.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"电视上说，要想成为绝世佳人，充分的休息也很重要……！","text_original":"素敵なレディーになるためには、休息も必要……！って、この前TVで見た！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/AAXmAaU8JOZ8r9xDzEEKlMHYapTeFYJU.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"阿椿前辈和三森前辈，现在在做什么呢~","text_original":"ツバキ先輩とミモリ先輩今は何してるのかな～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/DV83TPhdSAWL7dMygz1kHYcZuAZuInFN.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cardpickup_1","category":"other","text":"哇~这可是超级罕见的稀有卡啊！ 老师！太厉害了！这就是命运~！","text_original":"うぉー、これめっちゃレアカードじゃん！ 先生すごい、これぞディスティニー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/iyizZcZm5esP5Suqp6dKJlxI7WIZT1hN.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cardpickup_2","category":"other","text":"啊，是张超棒的卡！原来如此，这就是大人的力量……","text_original":"あ、良いカードじゃん！なるほど、これが大人の力……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/pYW8ePb4BnZoNBBuajfiwqybKpA80XYu.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cardpickup_3","category":"other","text":"啊，是很常见的卡。但也可以当成稀有卡嘛！","text_original":"あ、良く見るやつだ。でも普通にレアカードだと思うよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/EjgVhfK0gQkyy6JlolHEocoO89MSYyAx.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Cardpickup_4","category":"other","text":"呃，这个嘛……不，不要失望，老师！ 下次一定！能抽到更棒的卡！……应该吧。","text_original":"えっと……が、ガッカリしないで、先生！ 次はきっと良いのが出るから！……多分","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/p9ON5OkDCW5RPZb2h99D2GUvQU8KPPsH.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_CardShop_1","category":"other","text":"扑通扑通~！会是什么呢~？","text_original":"わくわく、何が出るかな～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/ltjCgELCn3io9n2oUHiQBXNWFg7STpP7.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_CardShop_2","category":"other","text":"抽到稀有卡当然是最好的！ 因为它们闪闪发光的，很漂亮，抽出的瞬间一定很开心！","text_original":"せっかくならレアカードが良いよね！ キラキラしてキレイだし、テンション上がる！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/U85OvH1v0IVq8r18NRVDpALrBTpYxwaW.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_CardShop_End","category":"other","text":"一口气全部抽掉怎么样？ 越是这种时候，越有可能抽到稀有卡！","text_original":"どうせだし、もう全部引いちゃえば？ こういう時ほど、レアカードが出そうだし！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/MG2VNGP2rQbl2VytKLW323cnQMF01sKx.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_CardShop_Login_1","category":"other","text":"在这里可以抽卡！老师，现在就来试试吧？","text_original":"ここではカードが引けるんだよ！早速どう、先生？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/2MnQJHMMuRBcZEu8IjSiWa8sKFmTt4eF.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_CardShop_Login_2","category":"other","text":"来，选一张~！到老师的回合了，抽卡吧！","text_original":"さぁどうぞ！先生のターンだよ、ドローして！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/9JY1000AxhYNeuffW2IFFTRp6TXOqOE0.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"咚！哈哈哈哈！","text_original":"ドーン！あはは！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/CEtaRrVvHwbDlzLCdjvdYA8lTKESCb3K.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"这次修行部要负责协助活动…… 呜啊啊~可我也想出去玩~！","text_original":"今回修行部はイベントを手伝う側なんだけど…… う～、私も遊びたい〜！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/gwic8Dlpw2bivTCimoXd0FaP97pkkTTt.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLobby_2","category":"event","text":"嗯？怎么了？是戳人的游戏吗？ 嘿嘿！我可不会输给你！呀啊~！呀哈~！","text_original":"ん？なに？相手を突っつく遊び？ 私も負けないよーっ！そりゃ、とりゃぁっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/UvWFnB86LdBcSJ8BhyBoXl7zgxr0wi8f.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLobby_3","category":"event","text":"我明白这样的工作也是修行的一环…… 但实在太无聊了！ 唔，我想出去玩……","text_original":"こういうお手伝いも、修行の一環！……って、分かってるんだけど、 退屈なものは退屈！ うーん、遊びに行きたい……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/IC8uEVr4bPAy05SCW6f9c5C3OYfp8lyZ.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLobby_4","category":"event","text":"呜——还是不行呀。这样一声不吭地待着也太无聊了！ ……啊，大声喊出来就感觉好多了。","text_original":"んーーーー……駄目、じっとしてるのはやっぱ退屈ー！ ……あ、叫んだらちょっとスッキリした","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/sdKq7RMvsiAG9Q1gLe0U5LNgucB1qFtL.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"欢迎光临百鬼夜行电影村！老师，我来为你导游！","text_original":"百鬼夜行の映画村にようこそー！私が案内してあげるね！先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/yRNHLQUeb4z8Ug8nOezchdJ63vlDfJEI.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"啊，老师！什么嘛，你现在就要去电影村玩吗？ 那我也想一起玩！ 呜，但是现在还不可以……","text_original":"あ、先生！なになに、これから映画村で遊ぶの？ じゃぁ私も一緒に遊びたーい！ あ、でも今はダメなんだった……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/E10A5K7w9He8AnHuMPKXi2D9cLaJnngk.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，电影村的娱乐项目怎么样？好不好玩？ 好羡慕~我也想体验一下~","text_original":"先生、映画村のアトラクションはどうだった？面白かった？ いいなー、私もそっち側体験したーい","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/W3KK4D05XKp9rcHCoAQy06PmA55ZOcRR.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，这么快就这个点了。呜，我还想再玩一会儿呢…… 结束后一起回去吧老师？","text_original":"あ、もうこんな時間なんだね うー、遊び足りない…… 終わったら一緒に行こうね、先生？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/ynCgL4s0PBn0TE3fzvKb1yIX0r8iVZaX.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_EventLogin_Season_End","category":"lobby","text":"咦，这么快就结束了？！ 唉~我还没和老师玩够呢…… 唉，算了。下次再和老师一起来吧！","text_original":"あれ、もしかしてもう終わり！？ えー、まだ全然先生と遊んでないのに…… まあいっか、また先生とくれば良いんだもんね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/dIuqFhLpjzjFo6gZKWaA1qGtIFWPdbHm.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"看，我帅气的样子！唔噢？！","text_original":"さあ、私のカッコいい姿を！うわあ！？ぐっ…ふぅ…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/bHMr5ZD64JsgKKirm8SX2vjVyyUcpnJ7.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"我要大展身手！唔哦？！危险危险……","text_original":"ここで大活躍を！はあっ！？…あ、あぶないあぶない…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/vlMOXLrbjydKsfgh5RKKaZQOSmr3D2qH.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿！这里要用必杀技！哇哦？！吓，吓我一跳……","text_original":"ふふふ、ここで必殺技！とわー！？びっくりした…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/X93W2oBKDpnECtJ5qgHbFxvSVJ9AGFAQ.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"信号弹，发射！走你！","text_original":"信号弾、発射！いっけー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/jz4JJKXwtnw8p3LqkipojWf5TL2FPr8I.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"我也可以帮上忙的！","text_original":"私だって力になれるんだから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/1gB8i5WLlwdkGYsHaqONvBHaXO2Qmr3P.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"越危险的时候越要坚强！阿枫，登场！","text_original":"ピンチの時こそ颯爽と！私、登場！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/whWLwAMFdF8ag90nluYICWg6Cx6DcSEK.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"呜哇——好帅……嘿……噢噢……哇……有了这个，就可以变得更强吗？啊哈哈，我感觉浑身充满了力量！老师，谢谢你——！","text_original":"うぉー、カッコイイ……へえ……おお…… わぁ……これ、もしかしてもっと 強くなれるやつ？あははっ！ 私、さらにパワーアップしちゃいそう！ 先生、ありがとー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/3SBf1EJZgATxQDQGzhbuEc44d5YTpLzy.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"哈，轮到我了？交给我吧交给我吧！","text_original":"お、私の番？任せて任せて！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/4PDZNudLQq215V07VLoTUh1GLQ6GFxp4.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"我？我！是我呀——！！加油加油！！","text_original":"私？私！私だ——！頑張る頑張る！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/PM4PyGZw6Ytb2FggPTgY2xXN9yB443mN.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"锵锵！修行部的吉祥物，堂堂登场！久等了，老师！今天我们要玩什么？","text_original":"修行部のマスコット。ババンと登場！お待たせ先生！で、今日は何しよっか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/tdEHHGABcr9nYvpxcch3KB2IPwgKDmDE.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"哇，老师，这个是给我的吗？谢谢你！","text_original":"うわぁー！先生、これくれるの？えへへ、ありがと！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/VHmuQlGb6KlEVxNmfMua5PeXqwy1A8PC.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"咦，这个，是给我的？太——好了！","text_original":"え、これ、私に！？やったー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/WVlZePCCpBz059kiOqpvQVAgBtk2Thr1.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"哦——！感觉浑身都充满了力量！啊，没有那种效果？什么嘛，只是心理作用嘛。","text_original":"おぉー、全身にみなぎるこの力……！え、そういう効果はない？なんだ、気のせいか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/LmPWbq1ZtgIk2yiePrqnMQH41BZ0kh52.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"咦，老师给我的礼物！这下应该能长高点吧。","text_original":"え、先生からのプレゼント！？これで少しは、背が伸びたりするかなぁ……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/L5aHeyW6rP7eTjuiBkOzxVxeM3XIz6Hd.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天玩点什么呢…… 作，作业当然会写完的！","text_original":"今日は何をして…… も、もちろん宿題もやるけど！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/Fa6fiyw2dTrcjlroWjWm8oPhK7fFVRb5.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"为了成为绝世佳人，每天都要坚持锻炼！ 嗯？你问是什么锻炼？ 首先，今天是跳绳100次！","text_original":"素敵なレディーになるためには、毎日の鍛錬が必須！ え、鍛錬の内容？ 今日はとりあえず、縄跳び１００回！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/nPgyq0aWgfNEVzZZcoWLlksW8RYCKaNE.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师知道吗？听说基沃托斯有代表正义的英雄！ 叫什么来着，好像是回转……什么的。","text_original":"あ、先生知ってる？キヴォトスにも正義のヒーローが居るんだって！ 確かカイテン……なんだっけ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/icv9OEby2wjTdiwtefKJeA14jjJH21Ck.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？不是正义的英雄？不一样吗？ ……唔，这是大人的事情？好难理解~","text_original":"え、正義のヒーローじゃないの？ちょっと違う？ ……うーん、なんか大人の事情があるの？難しいね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/a0XB7NYnSnog6DRjtVApOBiteRLCufsX.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师今天也要工作啊？工作有那么好玩吗？ ……咦？老师？你怎么这副表情？ 没，没事吧……？！呃，抱、抱歉……","text_original":"先生は今日も仕事？仕事って、そんなに面白い？ …え、先生？何でそんな顔してるの？ だ、大丈夫！？……何かごめん……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/DxB59HwLFfPZOfOC1kYeeo8csQESnpPo.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"别担心，有我在呢！ 要想成为绝世佳人，这样的训练也不能少。 所以今天就由我来当老师的秘书吧！嘻嘻嘻！是不是很开心？","text_original":"心配しないで、私がいてあげるから！ これも将来、立派なレディーになるための訓練だから 今日は私が、先生の秘書になってあげる！えへへっ！嬉しい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/sMs94EzWjqE9YUEmdNnYm6HzzHVIyDd2.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师！我正等你呢，我正等你呢！今天要做些什么？","text_original":"あっ、先生！待ってた待ってた！今日は何をする？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/QzqTR6lwGXZn69nY4lBQT2vD3XwwXnYL.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师！你迟到了~！《甲虫女王》已经开始了哦？！","text_original":"先生遅い！もう「ムシクイーン」始まっちゃうよ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/LOzhLp798wxQ6m8YFtd3LrXUIcyLMs0v.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嘿嘿嘿。","text_original":"……ふふっ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/kj5vupPorF5f3MXkQopoYSW5SGTvWv3G.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天好像发生了很多事呢。","text_original":"なんだか今日は、いろんなことがあったなー。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/QRBKMn91EIKmKTodw2JL81OWz2YyrCnK.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然一整天都过得糊里糊涂的……","text_original":"いろいろバタバタの一日だったけど……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/XBLWwqxDbUZj1TFWV1uwnQkYj2yp3kUE.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过多亏了老师，我又向前迈了一步，说不定离绝世佳人更近了呢？！","text_original":"先生のおかげで、また一歩立派なレディーに近付けたかも！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/RGAqZmIGK7kDN5Thf5wlIZzdubmzZSRn.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师！谢谢你！","text_original":"ありがとね、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/VuhIOGnHS8jUx9BF1OKvVFafZTm3jQWv.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢你一直帮我！","text_original":"いつも私のこと、手伝ってくれて！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/GH9o2SUvaLSmOrUpOogFY50hbub9klZj.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"真的？！知道了！","text_original":"本当！？やった！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/iXHRDJj2fYT7PjGFdrhA8TicyeO9OhZw.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"那，我就心怀这份喜悦，对老师展开攻击！","text_original":"じゃあこの嬉しい気持ちを込めて……先生に攻撃！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/zO5Qsz6ESXgWbQIHG9HHFS9yZBqYbQFA.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"接招吧，【钻角兔·究极体】，钻头爆击——！！","text_original":"くらえ、「ドリルホーンのウサギ・究極体」のドリルインパクトー！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/kVtELUNVosxKCAmjHA9TZuaTerJBC2fI.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"にひひっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/EkBGb3tXwQsFq82mhaK6hCVXexXcagFf.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师老师，你今天很闲吗？干脆在修行部睡一觉再走呀！","text_original":"先生先生！今日暇？もういっそのこと、修行室に泊まっていかない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/jBC7BS20fFbA4kmoxJgWWu6IpRznh3Sk.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"哦——！有了它，我就能成为绝世佳人！诶，不是这样吗？嗯……","text_original":"うおー！これで私も素敵なレディーに！え？それはちょっと違うかも？う～ん？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/LSytXPfqVozrSVh4K8m5z6BgLQKCuT0N.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"有老师和我一起玩，我真的很开心。嗯，最喜欢了！","text_original":"先生が何かと付き合ってくれるの、本当に嬉しいんだよね。うん、すっごく好き！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/jkeRrliGqL3KjHUgFAvlAyYP1DrbYLaw.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"都说礼物要送给重要的人，所以我要给老师送上我的宝物，这些亮闪闪的鹅卵石！怎么样，很闪吧？","text_original":"大事な相手には、プレゼントをあげるものなんだって！ だから先生には、私の宝物の、この光る石をあげる！ どーお？キラキラしてるでしょー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/VjARojzt41clVKWPnzk5VZArDFtx1tzX.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"啊，祝我生日快乐？ 嗯——嗯！谢谢老师！我是不是离绝世佳人又近了一步？ 如果是那样就好了！","text_original":"え、お誕生日？ うん、ありがとー先生！これで私も、立派なレディにまた一歩近付いたかな？ そうだと良いなっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/SeMj5u8mts3Y5OPF6hdKH2ww8AsR7moK.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Season_Birthday_Player_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师！生日快乐！ 看，这里！这是我为今天特别准备的生日礼物！","text_original":"あっ、先生！お誕生日おめでとう！ はい！今日のために用意した、私からの特別な誕生日プレゼント！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/pcnYWkKljMl4ahxuymZnKla1zr26JfDz.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Season_Birthday_Player_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？你问里面的是什么？是我上次抓到的蝉！ 嘿嘿嘿！快点，快打开看看！","text_original":"え、中身？私がこないだ捕まえたセミだよ！ ほらほら、早く開けて！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/RKvOVZefGDLBXelRFuu50sL91wIsqpj2.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"我上次在电视上看到过……万圣节其实是甜点公司的阴谋！ 竟然利用纯洁的梦想！不可饶恕！坚决反对！","text_original":"この間、TVで見たんだけど……ハロウィンって、お菓子メーカーの陰謀なんだって！ 純粋な夢を利用するなんて許せない！断固反対！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/YOzMjqdWkfma8AWUakAeHjofYNgF8zBj.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？这个甜点是给我的？ 啊哈哈！哇~！嘿嘿嘿！谢谢！","text_original":"……え？このお菓子、私にくれるの？ やったー！えへへっ、ありがと！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/df48Fl8abnTRj5zbUetw7m7mVMeuaS9H.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"老师！新年快乐！ 嗯？要给我红包？真的吗？！ 哇~！最喜欢老师了！","text_original":"あけましておめでとう、先生！ え、お年玉くれるの？本当に？ やったーー！先生大好き！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/9L3GBlMYHRxPz5UTRapzq9RgkcYHrf8X.ogg"},{"description":"Kaede_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐~！把阿椿前辈和三森前辈也叫过来， 大家一起开派对吧！我想吃炸鸡~！","text_original":"メリークリスマ～ス！ツバキ先輩とミモリ先輩を呼んで みんなでパーティーしよ！早くチキン食べたい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/QfLur0DvqnPshb60eamwDO5LdSfNYioi.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"kaede_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"电视上说，要想成为绝世佳人，充分的休息也很重要……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/aShkRXSpTmBOXlHou3D1gEoiISrb8yFV.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"阿椿前辈和三森前辈，现在在做什么呢~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/rRvl3CBZrIHgtiC8OezrTI5JJw9PG0kP.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardpickup_1","category":"event","text":"哇~这可是超级罕见的稀有卡啊！ 老师！太厉害了！这就是命运~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/hWSiwTIjXZ2Fi5HmSlGUQb6J3ErANYaK.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardpickup_2","category":"event","text":"啊，是张超棒的卡！原来如此，这就是大人的力量……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/Ytf4wdBa95W1Irc9VDgv1V5J3ZGPFKLe.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardpickup_3","category":"event","text":"啊，是很常见的卡。但也可以当成稀有卡嘛！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/8JHfsNCeIeiyZC57qYClAA8m4DeqMIWy.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardpickup_4","category":"event","text":"呃，这个嘛……不，不要失望，老师！ 下次一定！能抽到更棒的卡！……应该吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/GujhxTHNldXgvZzIWBkmtMLE9s1VrxGU.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardshop_1","category":"event","text":"扑通扑通~！会是什么呢~？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/OAUzlOX9RzEstiRldnb5RuiHJIX3r8t4.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardshop_2","category":"event","text":"抽到稀有卡当然是最好的！ 因为它们闪闪发光的，很漂亮，抽出的瞬间一定很开心！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/n3l1sgtmUkDdwRWIzw94Sri5h8EVw3B0.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardshop_end","category":"event","text":"一口气全部抽掉怎么样？ 越是这种时候，越有可能抽到稀有卡！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/vUjf7ZDlwD1CECwxt9APoZOAgv9shvVN.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardshop_login_1","category":"event","text":"在这里可以抽卡！老师，现在就来试试吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/v9ymVFCuq6yos4EZE7nXpvmLl7nAeYeH.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cardshop_login_2","category":"event","text":"来，选一张~！到老师的回合了，抽卡吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/om9EdDLdxXfdRerFV8NAxG626zjYCjWC.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"咚！哈哈哈哈！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/uJixEXUtzfdJKSsNKyaU4jnbUcpo5NXc.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"这次修行部要负责协助活动…… 呜啊啊~可我也想出去玩~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/2IChMDZiYqdVpIPsWB2hdajO8NWlm0Z9.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"嗯？怎么了？是戳人的游戏吗？ 嘿嘿！我可不会输给你！呀啊~！呀哈~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/XSI9ysoCnJlI9i1ThPiD4nTeaAaWiTHH.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"我明白这样的工作也是修行的一环…… 但实在太无聊了！ 唔，我想出去玩……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/CJcxZvANhuXgYo8wlIkmqLDqcNdHHu6Z.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"呜——还是不行呀。这样一声不吭地待着也太无聊了！ ……啊，大声喊出来就感觉好多了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/gFqnP7PIWvzGpzp5NBv487vJhZioHK8p.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"欢迎光临百鬼夜行电影村！老师，我来为你导游！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/8LaYyTopKXUmWkjPonSXCsfWsR0Lbq6k.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"啊，老师！什么嘛，你现在就要去电影村玩吗？ 那我也想一起玩！ 呜，但是现在还不可以……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/e9pInwG8O8NgflKGK4DN8tY1tZWAZl88.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"老师，电影村的娱乐项目怎么样？好不好玩？ 好羡慕~我也想体验一下~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/QKbEsszCv5iA7lSGdPpeWUocjK1AAjMw.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"啊，这么快就这个点了。呜，我还想再玩一会儿呢…… 结束后一起回去吧老师？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/BUejyz2cPTq3wvqbEwDHd6Eryxmj8014.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"咦，这么快就结束了？！ 唉~我还没和老师玩够呢…… 唉，算了。下次再和老师一起来吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/yatpuU3wyfbIAnmXCSdG7BOWpMZsFfqK.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"看，我帅气的样子！唔噢？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/rLKnT98df2Hu9KFf2x4CaILpvZSbfzQV.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"我要大展身手！唔哦？！危险危险……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/gleWrgSekvt2aiFhlE1IIi7eexR8ZPaX.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿！这里要用必杀技！哇哦？！吓，吓我一跳……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/fP8gPfCG5oKFZ9OvLe9a9UU2U0LjYiPX.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"信号弹，发射！走你！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/QGevvJYg36iXPV4ta7xpO4JL5L2sTv44.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"我也可以帮上忙的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/l2eE2AaGCV2AO4nA8v6wap4oLaV8cIwq.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"越危险的时候越要坚强！阿枫，登场！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/Hy0lZrMDYB30CxLY9OqmH2uLfTMUwf5b.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"呜哇——好帅……嘿……噢噢……哇……有了这个，就可以变得更强吗？啊哈哈，我感觉浑身充满了力量！老师，谢谢你——！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/5DTbr47RHrnhm9YtO4g2yusBoQnuLmS5.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"哈，轮到我了？交给我吧交给我吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/cs9XpSMBxld1xieAjqiIzrXfYxEyaHCl.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"我？我！是我呀——！！加油加油！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/ALHv1GTGMCqg9DMO3X0GyeJxXeUZo0G1.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"锵锵！修行部的吉祥物，堂堂登场！久等了，老师！今天我们要玩什么？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/MBopqCpcTdodaNTbokDvFgHwI14kJhsh.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"哇，老师，这个是给我的吗？谢谢你！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/TH3MFvvtD1SDaK4XjsOuz9FPxCstx5mY.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"咦，这个，是给我的？太——好了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/nwNwwEkjM5jjvOecwX9zPCPgiRPQjrK1.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"哦——！感觉浑身都充满了力量！啊，没有那种效果？什么嘛，只是心理作用嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/XWEd3VljbUayX24bkSKp1UJ09XyONLOy.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"咦，老师给我的礼物！这下应该能长高点吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/tKTJShDgnbBjdapOjhlQCujXrZ0PtiMN.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天玩点什么呢…… 作，作业当然会写完的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/WT8m8JmcGbHs1oZHb2QDdzuE6QBg001w.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"为了成为绝世佳人，每天都要坚持锻炼！ 嗯？你问是什么锻炼？ 首先，今天是跳绳100次！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/MnAWmdt4uD1JUwYZjakPGykUAnxxvAUN.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师知道吗？听说基沃托斯有代表正义的英雄！ 叫什么来着，好像是回转……什么的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/PHyPX72fBpEVtTDhhyMgMourzqX4YwIL.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？不是正义的英雄？不一样吗？ ……唔，这是大人的事情？好难理解~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/xZoVLkZdSoxvU7m5LiSfZsbEWYfWTBNp.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师今天也要工作啊？工作有那么好玩吗？ ……咦？老师？你怎么这副表情？ 没，没事吧……？！呃，抱、抱歉……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/wckeaSAgTvNQxHcmr6XJys3BMbCBN7hD.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"别担心，有我在呢！ 要想成为绝世佳人，这样的训练也不能少。 所以今天就由我来当老师的秘书吧！嘻嘻嘻！是不是很开心？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/8iwtGUj8jPN38vNbMmGSVq3TnpHT4Npf.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师！我正等你呢，我正等你呢！今天要做些什么？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/Ijh0D2GWJfbqW9JVDmJK0FXyR6ppJyRV.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师！你迟到了~！《甲虫女王》已经开始了哦？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/7GJXFAalQS3SKBISZfCOqXVSXdNcsv1M.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嘿嘿嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/Ktmcv4M5mosuUHmOOeRmxnTgcLWBP4Cq.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天好像发生了很多事呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/oArOb2ODPcKqCgk2Z74ZUhw4Xmo0hurN.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然一整天都过得糊里糊涂的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/nVPUmc46Y2FY5J6yBwKCvevGYPyjgk4j.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过多亏了老师，我又向前迈了一步，说不定离绝世佳人更近了呢？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/SsV9j0FAb9rPyJNMhnLi6TeIsc0hWC7T.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师！谢谢你！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/RVl8g7IR0DgsPQ9mvTD3E3D6nINpTu7h.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢你一直帮我！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/HlSFciasixJltcIe1zD35q0CjCS2vVfR.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"真的？！知道了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/sRBMKhwlbI7KRFpta8vF5WPDsRC9YK0P.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"那，我就心怀这份喜悦，对老师展开攻击！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/PBucmzWY9HjgMLTSpIYAazOWmcqNzycj.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"接招吧，【钻角兔·究极体】，钻头爆击——！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/Nyo5Zl3l2MqJcqlaMAWkYBnMsuQaozBc.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/fhKwma1v13KwSkeW7C4Ll9mR8gi9urZO.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师老师，你今天很闲吗？干脆在修行部睡一觉再走呀！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/IxCyrLxtTwoZXOHs5igLKbsuzpb2OoV0.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"哦——！有了它，我就能成为绝世佳人！诶，不是这样吗？嗯……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/BTnaFN4jdFrjPgw9FpxHeuj7hTfcjWmf.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"有老师和我一起玩，我真的很开心。嗯，最喜欢了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/8X9wUIxJv1NLvikXSeWLneWHD4J4GPBl.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"都说礼物要送给重要的人，所以我要给老师送上我的宝物，这些亮闪闪的鹅卵石！怎么样，很闪吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/dWGelo1yeO11HtLZRhQzB5pBQY6gSBWp.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"啊，祝我生日快乐？ 嗯——嗯！谢谢老师！我是不是离绝世佳人又近了一步？ 如果是那样就好了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/T7R98C9oayDCTtVsuLB5pqnD2KqqgLfd.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师！生日快乐！ 看，这里！这是我为今天特别准备的生日礼物！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/NEkaxynsqtpAWIDoIDwwnGEyAep2sloN.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？你问里面的是什么？是我上次抓到的蝉！ 嘿嘿嘿！快点，快打开看看！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/fUcE69Ik5Q8ji62QnQan2eECgNyVNKML.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐！新的一年，老师会继续陪我进行绝世佳人的修行吧？嘻嘻~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/vn1HYqQpj9ynVy8U0WBINVb44AynZmnz.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"我上次在电视上看到过……万圣节其实是甜点公司的阴谋！ 竟然利用纯洁的梦想！不可饶恕！坚决反对！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/2mNb1bkBblD5MsLiQklmMGQFDmqCmVL9.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？这个甜点是给我的？ 啊哈哈！哇~！嘿嘿嘿！谢谢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/Gr7LzrflYr0OComia7mXYrZDThGSqtSL.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老师老师，修行部的前辈们做了月饼！快来活动室和我们一起吃吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/PEmIl5qh7g12IOY2GofMCIsVzHoKpA7F.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师！新年快乐！ 嗯？要给我红包？真的吗？！ 哇~！最喜欢老师了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/4ITHjuvI8gbIRiG7yGqFTT04a99W4mMi.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐~！把阿椿前辈和三森前辈也叫过来， 大家一起开派对吧！我想吃炸鸡~！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/PE3ETovNMnpWH2rjcKsypUB6EKrFiE87.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/zCRRAXM2EyoXRqJfj48tzxgkK26lMSlh.ogg"},{"description":"kaede_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"呼，好困……眼睛……实在是……呜……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%8B%87%E7%BE%8E%20%E6%9E%AB/ZEKLf7GaemoT4MrBZDK3UpqxEyyIjjUO.ogg"},{"description":"